sequenceDiagram
  participant C as PostgreSQL client
  participant G as pg-gateway / ProxySession
  participant P as SessionJobPool
  participant M as Mapepire
  participant D as Db2 for i
  C->>G: Startup + proxy credentials
  G-->>C: AuthenticationOk
  G->>P: acquire SQLJob
  P-->>G: pinned job
  C->>G: Query / Parse+Bind+Execute
  G->>G: translate SQL + parameters
  G->>M: SQL on pinned job
  M->>D: JDBC request
  D-->>M: rows + metadata
  M-->>G: QueryResult
  G-->>C: RowDescription + DataRows + CommandComplete
  C-->>G: Terminate
  G->>P: ROLLBACK + reset schema + release
